        "original_id": "5463c029-3783-5086-8891-2c3dfda73864",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tricia Dickson, Danny Tamberelli, Katrina Johnson, Leon Frierson\n- Organizations: Nickelodeon\n- Products: All That\n- Roles: voice actress, actor, comedian, musician, cast member\n\nFacts:\n- Tricia Dickson was born on January 3, 1982, and she is an American voice actress.\n- Danny Tamberelli was born on February 8, 1982, and he is an American actor, comedian, and musician.\n- Tricia Dickson was briefly a cast member of Nickelodeon's sketch comedy series All That.\n- On All That, Tricia Dickson replaced Katrina Johnson.\n- In 1997, Tricia Dickson was fired from All That and was replaced by Danny Tamberelli and Leon Frierson.",
